   "title": "当前做法与问题",
   "html": "<div class='callout'><p><b>专业问题：</b>漏失样本占比低，单看准确率容易忽略高风险井。</p><p><b>输入资料：</b>历史井况特征与合成漏失标签。</p><p><b>服务目标：</b>学习特征与漏失标签的关系并展示贡献方向。</p></div><svg viewBox='0 0 720 250' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='固井漏失机理与人工判断的误差困局'><defs><marker id='c3a' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' refX='5' refY='3.5' orient='auto'><path d='M0,0 L7,3.5 L0,7 Z' fill='#b05a51'/></marker></defs><text x='30' y='20' font-size='10.5' font-weight='600' fill='#b05a51'>固井漏失：液柱压力压漏薄弱层</text><rect x='30' y='32' width='290' height='198' fill='#e9eef6'/><line x1='30' y1='96' x2='320' y2='96' stroke='#c9d4e4'/><rect x='30' y='156' width='290' height='36' fill='#d47a3a' fill-opacity='.14'/><text x='34' y='151' font-size='9' fill='#d47a3a'>薄弱层（漏失通道）</text><rect x='160' y='32' width='48' height='198' fill='#fff' stroke='#c9d4e4'/><line x1='174' y1='32' x2='174' y2='230' stroke='#41699b' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='194' y1='32' x2='194' y2='230' stroke='#41699b' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='150' y1='70' x2='218' y2='70' stroke='#2875c7' stroke-width='1.2' stroke-dasharray='5 3'/><text x='222' y='74' font-size='8.5' fill='#2875c7'>设计返高 3200 m</text><rect x='160' y='110' width='14' height='120' fill='#2875c7' fill-opacity='.3'/><rect x='194' y='110' width='14' height='120' fill='#2875c7' fill-opacity='.3'/><line x1='150' y1='110' x2='218' y2='110' stroke='#b05a51' stroke-width='1.4'/><text x='222' y='114' font-size='8.5' fill='#b05a51'>实际返高 2850 m</text><line x1='208' y1='166' x2='246' y2='166' stroke='#b05a51' stroke-width='2' marker-end='url(#c3a)'/><line x1='208' y1='180' x2='246' y2='180' stroke='#b05a51' stroke-width='2' marker-end='url(#c3a)'/><text x='250' y='177' font-size='8.5' fill='#b05a51'>水泥浆漏入</text><text x='34' y='226' font-size='9' fill='#64748b'>漏失 12 m³ → 返高差 350 m → 挤水泥补救</text><line x1='350' y1='20' x2='350' y2='232' stroke='#dfe6f0'/><text x='380' y='20' font-size='10.5' font-weight='600' fill='#41699b'>人工判断：手算 ECD 对窗口</text><text x='380' y='56' font-size='9.5' fill='#52627a'>窄窗口井：窗口宽度 vs 手算误差</text><rect x='400' y='96' width='70' height='34' fill='#d47a3a' fill-opacity='.16'/><rect x='470' y='96' width='120' height='34' fill='#2875c7' fill-opacity='.2' stroke='#2875c7' stroke-dasharray='4 3'/><rect x='590' y='96' width='90' height='34' fill='#d47a3a' fill-opacity='.16'/><text x='530' y='118' font-size='9.5' fill='#164b88' text-anchor='middle' font-family='monospace'>窗口 0.10</text><text x='435' y='90' font-size='9' fill='#d47a3a' text-anchor='middle'>手算误差 ±0.05</text><text x='635' y='90' font-size='9' fill='#d47a3a' text-anchor='middle'>手算误差 ±0.05</text><line x1='380' y1='150' x2='690' y2='150' stroke='#52627a' stroke-width='1'/><text x='382' y='164' font-size='8.5' fill='#41699b'>Pp 下限</text><text x='688' y='164' font-size='8.5' fill='#b05a51' text-anchor='end'>Pf 上限</text><text x='380' y='196' font-size='9.5' fill='#64748b'>误差与窗口同量级——算完也不敢拍板，只能凭老工程师的区块经验。</text><text x='380' y='216' font-size='9.5' fill='#b05a51' font-weight='600'>漏与不漏，就差在这 0.05 g/cm³ 里。</text></svg><div class='figcap'><b>专业原理示意</b><span>用于解释业务概念和空间、参数关系；图中数字与对照为教学示意，不是现场成果。</span></div>"
