   "no": 3,
   "en": "DATA",
   "title": "你需要准备什么",
   "html": "<p>本地演示无需接入现场。下面的数据清单用于说明这一业务的资料要求，不表示项目已取得这些实测资料。</p><p>漏失记录天然就是标签，<b>不需要人工标注</b>——真正的工作量是把完井报告、钻井日志里的散落数据清洗成规整的特征表。压力剖面是解释值、本身带误差，特征要构造成「裕量」形式，并记录每一项的来源与不确定度。</p><div class='checklist'><div class='cl-head'><span>数据准备清单 · 3 项</span><span class='cl-prog'><span id='cl-txt'>0 / 3</span><span class='cl-bar'><i id='cl-fill'></i></span></span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='0'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>井况与地层压力</span><span class='cl-s'>孔隙压力、破裂压力、井径（单区块 200—1000 井次）</span></span><span class='cl-n'>解释值，需记录来源</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='1'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>浆柱设计</span><span class='cl-s'>密度、浆柱结构、泵注排量</span></span><span class='cl-n'>作为输入特征</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='2'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>漏失记录</span><span class='cl-s'>是否漏失、漏失量、漏失层位</span></span><span class='cl-n'>作为标签</span></div></div>"
